<title>USA: Select Appointments expands board.</title>
<headline>Select Appointments expands board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Select Appointments (Holdings) Plc said Tuesday it named Phyllis Kaminsky to the company's board.</p>
<p>This appointment increases the size of the board to five members and the number of independent directors to three, the company said.</p>
<p>Kaminsky heads Kaminsky Associates, which she founded in 1989. This firm provides consulting services in the areas of international marketing, overseas business development, communications strategy, public affairs, and government relations to U.S. based and international companies.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
